      "decision_delay_seconds": 0.5,
      "gaps": "windows are replayed in order per device; a non-contiguous window is a gap and DevicePolicy resets the series, which is the declared baseline",
      "max_lease_seconds": 600,
      "max_result_age": 2.5,
      "rearm": "after every lease expiry the episode is re-armed, as an operator or reconcile step would; without it a device could be quarantined at most once and the rate would be capped by construction",
